<p>His first wife was Pera Matišić, from a well-known Croatian musical family, with whom he had a son, Josip. Pera died in 1919 from the Spanish flu.</p>

<p>His second marriage was to a woman from the Budić family. They had a son, Martin, who was killed near Bihać in 1942 and never married.</p>

<p>His third marriage was to Joza Dragun, with no children.</p>

