<p>No further information exists about his son Mijo beyond the birth record. It is assumed he either died young or moved away.</p>

<p>Descendants through Jozo, Mate, and Petar are known as <strong>Tucići</strong>, a nickname given due to the family’s reputation for romantic adventures.</p>    
  
